d efficiency in terms of good and  compliant output  a validated calculation framework is  mandatory  but we need more we need predefined  result sets  that is well-defined output with no  random changes  layouts corporate identity including  logos  headers cover pages summaries  easily summarizing a validation  project's main results  formulas optional report elements for  better documentation  but validation project should not only  contain calculations but all data  integrity related info  21 severe part 11 compliance  data integrity full compliance to 21  serial part 11 or equivalent regulations  like eu  gmp annex 11. data protection can be  guaranteed by software access levels  logins roles departments and check some  protected backend databases  like sql servers the whole workflow must  be completely checked by means of audit  trails  all activities in detail as well as  revision history  searchable and retrievable auditors have  a very close look on all aspects of  electronic data  21 cfl part 11. besides validation and  part 11 compliance certificates  a 21 cfr part 11 compliance response is  mandatory  this compliance response provides  detailed answers for the requirements of  part 11  it's a mandatory document when using a  software in regulated environments  it is part of your software  documentation as well as iq and ocu  protocols  and other quality related paperwork  workflow establishing an optimized  workflow with minimum effort  templates the key for optimized workflow  is predefining all aspects of typical  method validation work  by workflow templates that reduce new  projects to a few clicks  such templates follow your sops contain  typical workflows and workloads  and structure your tasks to optimize  efficiency and compliance  communication with your laboratory  equipment like cds  lins ecm erp dms  should be automatic and easy with manual  intervention limited  to a minimum  guidelines and validation structure  guidelines are translated into  validation workload for example  checkpoints to create and structure  validation projects  as you can see this example  software product has translated all  these guidelines  into checkpoints and these checkpoints  are available  for creating and structuring new  validation projects  testing workload your testing workload  is defined by your  accreditation authority customers sops  and your personal ambitions  in any case the testing workload must be  well defined and not random  it must be clear why a specific workflow  as well its acceptance tracking has been  selected  this workflow definition is established  as a validation plan  that needs to be approved prior to data  acquisition start  custom workflows  adopting new or changed workflows should  be as easy as possible  graphical design tools business process  managers  allow user-designed workflows without  software modification  different projects require different  workflows that can be selected from  predefined designs  documentation more than result  calculation  documentation method validation work is  much more than just calculating results  it is setting up your testing workload  both simple and flexible  with final documentation magic customer  expectations  as well as regulatory requirements  this requires a highly configurable and  powerful reporting solution  to create documentation templates for  all purposes  internal as well as official validation  reports  best practices  important and frequently used report  elements should be available for  immediate usage  for example text blocks snippet  libraries  ease this process and guarantee good  reporting quality  this applies to headers approval  sections cover pages  resulted acceptance tables and lots of  other elements  final documentation final method  validation documentation needs to be  easy to understand well structured  illustrated when necessary easily  summarized to get the main result  document transfer and protection  final documents must follow established  standards for easy exchange  like pdf a 1b  2b 3b and they must be well protected by  secure algorithms  like aap  document transfer and protection  final documents must follow established  standards for easy exchange  like the pdfa standard and well  protected by secure algorithms  that give a good protection against  hacking  integration full device integration is  the key  manual data input should be avoided  whenever possible  automatic transfer eliminates the need  to control and check manual inputs  all laboratory systems need to be  attached to your method validation  software  like cds chromatography data systems  limbs lab information management systems  erp enterprise resource planning ecm  enterprise content management and dms  document management systems  interface workflow interfaces connect  your validation projects to external  data sources  data is automatically transferred  predefined workflows control data flow  and reduce time and eliminate input  errors  a new validation project is created  based on an improved template  it connects to a data source like cds  lims erp or ecm  it assigns and load data by using an  automatic data transfer  and it creates a final validation report  using the pdf a  format that is protected and sent  [Music]  flexibility even a method validation  project based on a well-established  template might need modifications for a  specific pending project  product fine tuning while templates  define routine work  it's critical to allow flexibility for  each new project  additional calculations graphics and  report extensions must be added easily  as it is viable to allow fine tuning of  your projects for a specific purpose  for example different testing workflow  additional calculations  or modified layout in any case  such modifications must be fully tracked  the difference to the underlying  template explained  and justified in the validation plan  data integrity your data is worth being  protected  you need a maximum level of data  integrity since your data is worth being  protected all this must be accompanied  by a maximum level of data integrity  which means strict access control  detailed traceability version history  and full twenty-one severe particle  compliance  centralized installations application  database server  are strongly recommended to keep your  data safe and to ease application  rollouts  and maintenance installation  qualification must be ensured by  automated  iq and oq processes as well as  pq workflows  tools for qa and it admins and qa have  lots of requests for data integrity  and consistency checks to be carried out  on a regular basis  all these queries can be done based on  existing auditory information  and should be available on a single  click with graphical output dashboards  and report output before documentation  summary efficient method validation  workflow with full device integration  our goal should be to work as efficient  as possible with the highest level of  documentation quality  data integrity is a core requirement  tool get it into your lab workflow with  interfaces  to all relevant systems cds lims erp  ecm dms approved templates for routine  work are mandatory  but flexibility and fine tuning of  projects are necessary  tools must be validated and the  installation qualified  iq oqpq  in case you want to contact me for to  get further information  on optimized workflows please feel free  to contact me at any time  you can see my phone numbers my email  address  and our company home page thank you

